        <p class="folio-kicker">Get Started</p>
        <h2 class="ag-h2">Tell Us About Your Business</h2>
        <p class="ag-sub">Fill this out and we'll build your site. We'll reach out within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>
      <form id="agency-lead-form" class="ag-form">
        <div class="ag-form-rows">
          <div class="ag-form-grid">
            <div class="ag-field">
              <label for="form-name" class="ag-label">Your Name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="form-name" name="name" required class="ag-input" placeholder="John Doe" />
            </div>
            <div class="ag-field">
              <label for="form-business" class="ag-label">Business Name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="form-business" name="business" required class="ag-input" placeholder="Joe's Plumbing" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ag-form-grid">
            <div class="ag-field">
              <label for="form-phone" class="ag-label">Phone *</label>
              <input type="tel" id="form-phone" name="phone" required class="ag-input" placeholder="(209) 555-0100" />
            </div>
            <div class="ag-field">
              <label for="form-email" class="ag-label">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="form-email" name="email" class="ag-input" placeholder="john@joesplumbing.com" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ag-field">
            <label for="form-industry" class="ag-label">Industry</label>
            <select id="form-industry" name="industry" class="ag-input">
              <option value="">Select your industry</option>
              <option value="HVAC">HVAC</option>
              <option value="Plumbing">Plumbing</option>
              <option value="Electrical">Electrical</option>
              <option value="Restaurant">Restaurant</option>
              <option value="Retail">Retail</option>
              <option value="Dental">Dental</option>
              <option value="Real Estate">Real Estate</option>
              <option value="Auto">Auto / Mechanic</option>
              <option value="Beauty">Beauty / Salon</option>
              <option value="Other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="ag-field">
            <label for="form-needs" class="ag-label">What do you need?</label>
            <textarea id="form-needs" name="needs" rows="3" class="ag-input" placeholder="Tell us about your business and what kind of site you want..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="ag-btn">
            Get My Website →
          </button>
          <p class="ag-form-note">We'll reach out within 24 hours. No obligation, no spam.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div id="form-success" style="display:none;" class="ag-success">
        <div class="ag-success-mark">✅</div>
        <h3>Thanks, we got your info!</h3>
        <p>We'll reach out within 24 hours to get started on your site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      document.getElementById('agency-lead-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        const form = e.target;
        const data = {
          name: form.name.value,
          business: form.business.value,
          phone: form.phone.value,
          email: form.email.value,
          industry: form.industry.value,
          needs: form.needs.value,
          source: 'agency-page',
          timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
        };
        try {
          const resp = await fetch('https://cc3po.com/api/agency-lead', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify(data)
          });
          if (resp.ok) {
            form.style.display = 'none';
            document.getElementById('form-success').style.display = 'block';
          }
        } catch(e) {
          // Fallback: show success anyway
          form.style.display = 'none';
          document.getElementById('form-success').style.display = 'block';
        }
      });
    </script>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="ag-panel">
      <p class="folio-kicker" style="margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="ag-h2 ag-h2-left" style="font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="ag-faq-grid">
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>Can I use my own domain?</h3>
          <p>Yes! If you already own a domain, we'll point it to your new site. No extra cost. We handle the DNS configuration for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>How much does a domain cost?</h3>
          <p>Domains are ~$10-15/year for .com through <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" target="_blank" class="ag-link">SiteGround</a>. We handle the registration for you, or you can buy it yourself through our affiliate link.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>What if I want to buy my own domain?</h3>
          <p>Use our <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" target="_blank" class="ag-link">dedicated affiliate link</a> to register your domain or hosting. We earn a commission that helps keep our service prices low. Then send us the domain name and we'll set everything up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>Do I need to use Bolt.new myself?</h3>
          <p>No. You just tell us what you need — we build it on Bolt.new for you. You review and approve. We handle everything else. If you <em>want</em> to build your own sites, you can use Bolt.new directly, but it's not required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>What's a white-label portal?</h3>
          <p>When you sign up, you get access to your own dashboard where you can manage your site, email accounts, and billing. It's branded as "CC3PO" — no SiteGround or third-party branding. You log in at your own URL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-faq">
          <h3>Can I transfer my existing site?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We migrate your existing site to our hosting for free. Just pick a plan and we handle the rest. We support WordPress, static sites, and most custom builds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
